  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Upexi now operates as a Solana treasury company, with legacy consumer brands as a secondary revenue stream. A crypto slump triggered large unrealized SOL losses that overwhelmed revenue growth. Performance now hinges on Solana’s price; staking income contributes but doesn’t offset volatility. Market sentiment tracked crypto, with the stock dipping below net asset value.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is executing an accretive per-share Solana accumulation plan. It repurchased shares at a discount, issued convertible notes at dilution-proof terms, and raised equity above net asset value—all increasing SOL per share. Management acknowledged the tough quarter, stressing disciplined capital action. The approach is consistent but ties the company’s fate to Solana’s price and the digital treasury narrative’s appeal.",
